# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
#
# Losing the release key means you can never ship an update to an already
# installed app: Android rejects an APK signed with a different key. Back this
# file up somewhere durable, and inject it from a secret store in CI rather than
# committing it. scripts/make-keystore.ps1 generates a local one.
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Build output
**/build/
*.apk
*.aab
